n__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1215050-strix-night-horrors-book?p=1215110#post1215110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, considering that they already showed up in a Night Horror book, it is hard for me to believe that if Vampire were to get a 3rd Night Horror book (when other games still have non), it would be about the strix.</div> </div> </div> </div> What do you think it would be about?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T07:32:33-07:00","id":1215781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1215050-strix-night-horrors-book?p=1215768#post1215768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What do you think it would be about?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Immortal Sinners has already covered the &quot;elder/dangerous vampires&quot; niche, and Wicked Dead did the all &quot;weird monsters&quot; one (which is going to be further examined in Spilled Blood), so without adding a new &quot;special antagonist splat&quot; I would have written it as dedicated for dangerous vampire covenants (Belial's Brood, I'm looking at you!), vampire hunters and blood cultists (the night's greatest threat), ghouls (when servants go rouge) and perhaps &quot;blood anomalies&quot;- not weird vampires as much as weird things created or powered by Vitae. Things like independent gargoyles, or the Sutina from my homebrew sig, Sunwalking/Gloconda achieving vampires, alchemical monsters brought into life from bloody birthing pits, Malakavia or any other weird condition which vampires could suffer from, or which could be created by chaotic exposure to Vitae.<br /> <br /> But again, as Vampire already has two Night Horror books, I wouldn't expect for such book anytime soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 05-06-2018, 10:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T07:38:42-07:00","id":1215784,"title":"","content":"oh on gargoyles?<br /> <br /> Can they still be created by vamps like the